abstract: >-
  Art and cultural places in European cities, curated for the STARTUP project
  (Horizon Europe, Grant Agreement No 101178523). Covers eight cities/regions
  across Europe. Combines data from the Overture Maps Foundation places theme
  with locally curated submissions.
